  <h1>UniAR: One Tokenizer to Unify Multimodal Understanding and Generation</h1>
  <p class="lead">Most unified multimodal models secretly use <em>two</em> visual tokenizers — one for understanding, one for generation — forcing an awkward re-encoding step whenever the model wants to "see" what it just generated. UniAR bridges this split with a single Binary Spherical Quantization tokenizer fusing shallow and deep ViT features, enabling a shared context where generated images are immediately interpretable without any extra encoding pass.</p>
