<!-- Listen-friendly hidden summary -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display:none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: UniAR — One Tokenizer to Unify Multimodal Understanding and Generation</h2>
    <p>UniAR is a unified autoregressive multimodal model from Fudan University and the Qwen Team that addresses a fundamental flaw in existing unified models: they secretly use two separate visual tokenizers — one for semantic understanding and one for pixel-level generation — which breaks the shared context and forces re-encoding whenever the model needs to reason about its own generated images.</p>
    <p>UniAR's solution is a single Binary Spherical Quantization tokenizer that fuses features from four ViT layers, encoding both shallow texture details and deep semantic information into 64-bit binary vectors. With 2 to the 64th power possible codes and no explicit codebook, vocabulary scales exponentially at minimal cost. Parallel bitwise prediction over 2-by-2 spatial groups and four ViT levels simultaneously achieves 32-times sequence compression, reducing a 512-by-512 image to just 256 autoregressive steps. The shared token space enables an emergent capability: UniAR can generate an image then immediately answer questions about it in the same context without re-encoding. Benchmarks show state-of-the-art text rendering — scoring 0.873 on OneIG-EN, surpassing GPT-4o, and 0.917 on LongText-EN, surpassing Gemini 2.5 Flash Image.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：UniAR——统一多模态理解与生成的单一分词器</h2>
    <p>UniAR是复旦大学与Qwen团队联合提出的统一自回归多模态模型，针对现有统一模型的核心缺陷：它们实际上依赖两个独立的视觉分词器——一个用于语义理解，一个用于像素级生成——导致上下文分裂，模型每次需要理解自身生成的图像时都必须重新编码。</p>
    <p>UniAR的核心方案是一个单一的二元球形量化（BSQ）分词器，融合ViT模型四个层次的特征，将浅层纹理细节与深层语义信息共同编码为64位二进制向量。理论词汇量达2的64次方，无需显式码本，词汇量以指数级扩展。通过对2×2空间块和四个ViT层级同时进行并行比特预测，实现32倍序列压缩，512×512图像仅需256步自回归推断。共享的token空间带来涌现能力：UniAR可在同一上下文中生成图像后直接回答相关问题，无需重新编码。基准测试中，UniAR在OneIG-EN文字渲染基准上以0.873分超越GPT-4o，在LongText-EN上以0.917分超越Gemini 2.5 Flash。</p>
